  "idea": "Tally forms integrated with Discord webhooks for instant community alerts",
  "text": "This is the easiest way to build interactive client intake forms without monthly fees. Founders pay thirty dollars monthly for Typeform only to copy applicant responses manually into team chats. That disconnect creates operational bottlenecks and lets hot sales leads slip away unnoticed. Instead, build multi-step forms in Tally and fire instant payloads into Discord using native webhooks. Your pipeline updates live while eliminating costly subscriptions.",
